        "content": "// Potenciômetro no A0: imprime a leitura do ADC (0-1023) a cada 100 ms.\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  Serial.print(\"A0=\");\n  Serial.println(analogRead(A0));\n  delay(100);\n}"
